        <mxCell id="subtitle" value="Code refs: vault/builder.py:_load_occupation_files → domains/&lt;domain&gt;/&lt;slug&gt;.md · _load_persona_files → personas/&lt;handle&gt;/&lt;slug&gt;/neurons/&lt;section&gt;/&lt;slug&gt;.md · composer.py:_build_and_record (composed shape)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=11;align=left;fontStyle=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
