        <mxCell id="drift" value="CODE-vs-SPEC DRIFT: spec team/03-vault-generation.md §1 writes the occupation tree under base/&lt;domain&gt;/&lt;slug&gt;.md. The shipped builder writes domains/&lt;domain&gt;/&lt;slug&gt;.md (no base/ prefix). docs/vault-format.md agrees with the code. Persona neurons emit links to base/&lt;slug&gt; by convention and the composer rewrites those to the actual domains/&lt;domain&gt;/&lt;slug&gt; path (composer._link_resolver_for_paths — Wave-5 'polish 2' fix)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEE2E2;strokeColor=#B91C1C;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontStyle=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
